Forza Horizon 1: ReImagined (Dyotson), MIT License
https://github.com/Dyotson/ForzaHorizon1-ReImagined (patches/rexglue-sdk)

  - Shared memory uploads recorded ahead of the render pass (Vulkan) or the run
    of draws (Direct3D 12) that needs them, instead of in between the draws:
    the scheme follows patch 0036 (vulkan-hoist-shared-memory-uploads-before-
    render-pass), and the page bit code is its code. In
    src/graphics/vulkan/ (command_processor, shared_memory,
    deferred_command_buffer) and src/graphics/d3d12/ (command_processor,
    shared_memory, deferred_command_list), .cpp and .h.
  - Vulkan command buffers recorded and submitted on a thread of their own:
    the design follows patch 0038 (vulkan-threaded-submission). In
    src/graphics/vulkan/command_processor.cpp and .h and
    src/graphics/vulkan/deferred_command_buffer.cpp and .h.

The same notice is kept in the source, above the code it covers (in
src/graphics/d3d12/shared_memory.cpp and
src/graphics/vulkan/command_processor.cpp).

